Package: meld3pexa
Title: MELD 3.0 Score - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("W. Ray", "Kim", role = "ctb", comment = "First author of MELD 3.0"))
Description: Implements the MELD 3.0 score for end-stage liver disease and its
    published 90-day survival estimate (Kim et al., Gastroenterology 2021
    <doi:10.1053/j.gastro.2021.08.050>). This is the research score from the
    paper, not the OPTN organ-allocation calculator: it has no dialysis rule
    and no cap at 40.
